# NoteDrift environment variables.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (which is git-ignored) and fill in the values
# from your Supabase project's API settings. NoteDrift runs fully anonymous and
# local-first WITHOUT these — auth simply stays hidden until they are present.
#
# BOTH values below are browser-safe. The URL is public, and the anon key is
# designed to be shipped to clients (it grants nothing on its own; access is
# governed by Row Level Security on the server).
#
# NEVER put the Supabase service-role key (or any secret) in a NEXT_PUBLIC_*
# variable — those are inlined into the browser bundle. This app does not use a
# service-role key at all.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
